  Cell[TextData[{"Each edge p joining beads i and j carries three things: its \
length r, the unit vector u = (", Cell[BoxData[SubscriptBox["x", "i"]]], 
     " - ", Cell[BoxData[SubscriptBox["x", "j"]]], 
     ")/r, and a radial basis ", Cell[BoxData[SubscriptBox["\[Rho]", "k"]]], 
     "(r) = exp(-\[Gamma] (r - ", Cell[BoxData[SubscriptBox["\[Mu]", "k"]]], 
     Cell[BoxData[SuperscriptBox[")", "2"]]], ") on 16 centres ", 
     Cell[BoxData[SubscriptBox["\[Mu]", "k"]]], " between 0.6 and 1.5. The \
incidence matrix A has, in column p, +1 at bead i and -1 at bead j."}], 
   "Text"], Cell["MatrixPlot[topo[\"Ab\"], PlotLabel -> \"Bond incidence \
