   "Subsection"], Cell["ForceNetGraphPlot draws the network as a \
computational graph. It reads the shape on every edge from the network \
itself, so it is right for any chain length. Colours: blue = input ports \
(computed from the bead positions), orange = the two learned edge networks \
(the only trainable weights), grey = frozen arrays (the incidence matrices, \
learning rate 0), green = fixed operations without weights, red = the output \
port. Edge labels are tensor shapes for one frame.", "Text"], 
