  Cell["Langevin runs at N = 16, 32 and 64 with the reference and with the \
learned field: 4 chains each, 20 000 equilibration steps, 500 frames every \
200 steps.", "Text"], Cell["nnRun = TabulatedLangevin[tab]; \
SeedRandom[99];\nmd = Association@Flatten@Table[{{n, \"ref\"} -> \
GenerateData[n, 4, 20000, 500, 200],\n     {n, \"nn\"} -> GenerateData[n, 4, \
20000, 500, 200, nnRun]}, {n, {16, 32, 64}}];", "Input", 
   CellLabel -> "In[15]:="], Cell["blk[v_] := StandardDeviation[Mean /@ \
Partition[v, 100]]/Sqrt[Length[v]/100];\nstats[n_, k_] := Module[{fr = md[{n, \
k}][[All, 1]], rg2},\n  rg2 = RadiusOfGyration[#]^2 & /@ fr;\n  \
{Sqrt[Mean[rg2]], blk[rg2]/(2 Sqrt[Mean[rg2]]), Mean[Flatten[BondLengths /@ \
fr]], Mean[Flatten[BondAngles /@ \
fr]]/Degree}];\nGrid[Prepend[Flatten[Table[{n, k, Sequence @@ (NumberForm[#, \
4] & /@ stats[n, k])}, {n, {16, 32, 64}}, {k, {\"ref\", \"nn\"}}], 1],\n  \
